---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Terms and conditions for using PCMC Diary.">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div class="page-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract"></i></div>
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="page-sub"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> Last updated: 12 September 2026</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-body">
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i> 1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing or using PCMC Diary (pcmcdiary.com), you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the website.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> 2. Nature of Service</h2>
          <p>PCMC Diary is a hyperlocal business directory that lists businesses in Pimpri-Chinchwad. We do not own, operate, or endorse the businesses listed. Listings are provided for informational purposes only.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-check-double"></i> 3. Listing Accuracy</h2>
          <p>While we make reasonable efforts to verify premium listings, we do not guarantee 100% accuracy of any information (address, phone, offers, prices). Users should confirm details directly with the business before making decisions.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card"></i> 4. Paid Plans</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Paid listing plans are billed annually (or as specified)</li>
            <li>Payments are non-refundable except as described in our <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a></li>
            <li>We reserve the right to change pricing with prior notice</li>
            <li>Paid listings do not guarantee sales, leads, or rankings</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-ban"></i> 5. Prohibited Use</h2>
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Post false, misleading, or fraudulent information</li>
            <li>Scrape, copy, or republish our content without permission</li>
            <li>Use the platform for illegal activities</li>
            <li>Impersonate another business or person</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-copyright"></i> 6. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on PCMC Diary — including logo, design, text, and data compilation — is our property or licensed to us. Reproduction without permission is prohibited.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i> 7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>PCMC Diary is not liable for any loss, damage, or dispute arising from your dealings with businesses listed on our platform. All transactions are between you and the business.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> 8. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-gavel"></i> 9. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts in Pune, Maharashtra.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> 10. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions about these Terms, email <a href="mailto:info@pcmcdiary.com">info@pcmcdiary.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
.page { background: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 20px 80px; min-height: 60vh; }
.page-container { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px 52px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.04), 0 12px 32px -16px rgba(15,23,42,0.08); border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
.page-header { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 32px; margin-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
.page-icon { width: 64px; height: 64px; margin: 0 auto 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626, #991b1b); border-radius: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -8px rgba(220,38,38,0.4); }
.page-header h1 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.15; }
.page-sub { font-size: 13.5px; color: #64748b; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 6px 14px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 50px; }
.page-body section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
.page-body h2 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.page-body h2 i { color: #dc2626; font-size: 15px; width: 20px; text-align: center; }
.page-body p { color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 0; }
.page-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 12px 0 0; }
.page-body ul li { padding: 8px 14px 8px 36px; position: relative; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.page-body ul li::before { content: '\f111'; font-family: 'Font Awesome 6 Free'; font-weight: 900; position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 11px; color: #dc2626; font-size: 5px; }
.page-body a { color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
.page-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .page { padding: 20px 12px 60px; }
  .page-container { padding: 32px 22px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .page-header h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  .page-icon { width: 54px; height: 54px; font-size: 22px; border-radius: 14px; }
  .page-body h2 { font-size: 16px; }
  .page-body p, .page-body ul li { font-size: 13.5px; }
}
</style>
